            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '95' TO IO-STATUS
            PERFORM Z-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS
            EXPECT IO-STATUS-04(1:1) TO BE '9'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

