      ******************************************************************
      *  TC22 -- 0000-DALYTRAN-OPEN error branch (status not 00)
      *
      *  Drives 0000-DALYTRAN-OPEN (production lines 252-268) along
      *  the error branch.  Pre-set DALYTRAN-STATUS = '35' (file-
      *  not-found per VSAM convention).  Production:
      *    L255 IF DALYTRAN-STATUS = '00' false ->
      *    L258 MOVE 12 TO APPL-RESULT
      *    L260 IF APPL-AOK false ->
      *    L263 DISPLAY 'ERROR OPENING DAILY TRANSACTION FILE'
      *    L264 MOVE DALYTRAN-STATUS TO IO-STATUS
      *    L265 PERFORM Z-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS
      *    L266 PERFORM Z-ABEND-PROGRAM (CALL CEE3ABD ONCE)
      *
      *  Coverage gain: error-path lines 257-267, plus dispatch
      *  through Z-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS and Z-ABEND-PROGRAM (the
      *  latter mocked).  IO-STATUS = '35' after MOVE.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN01C 0000-DALYTRAN-OPEN error branch status 35'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '35' TO DALYTRAN-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 0000-DALYTRAN-OPEN
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 12
            EXPECT IO-STATUS TO BE '35'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

