      *  DALYTRAN-STATUS) per the production code.  This is a
      *  production source bug that we test as-is per the AAP "ONLY
      *  modify test files" rule.
      *
      *  Pre-set: DALYTRAN-STATUS='35' to enter the error branch,
      *  CUSTFILE-STATUS='44' to make the IO-STATUS assertion
      *  unambiguous against the bug.
