      *
      *  Drives 1000-DALYTRAN-GET-NEXT (production lines 202-225)
      *  along the non-EOF error branch.  Pre-set DALYTRAN-STATUS =
      *  '23' (record-not-found per VSAM convention).  Production:
      *    L204 IF DALYTRAN-STATUS = '00' false ->
      *    L207 IF DALYTRAN-STATUS = '10' false ->
      *    L210 MOVE 12 TO APPL-RESULT
      *    L213 IF APPL-AOK false ->
      *    L216 IF APPL-EOF false ->
      *    L219 DISPLAY 'ERROR READING DAILY TRANSACTION FILE'
      *    L220 MOVE DALYTRAN-STATUS TO IO-STATUS
      *    L221 PERFORM Z-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS
      *    L222 PERFORM Z-ABEND-PROGRAM
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN01C 1000-DALYTRAN-GET-NEXT error status 23 abends'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '23' TO DALYTRAN-STATUS
            MOVE 7777 TO APPL-RESULT
            PERFORM 1000-DALYTRAN-GET-NEXT
            EXPECT APPL-RESULT TO BE 12
            EXPECT IO-STATUS TO BE '23'
            EXPECT END-OF-DAILY-TRANS-FILE TO BE 'N'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' HAPPENED ONCE

      ******************************************************************
