      *  = '0A' (IO-STAT1='0' digit, IO-STAT2='A' non-digit).
      *  IO-STATUS NOT NUMERIC is TRUE so the IF arm executes (lines
      *  479-483 binary representation).
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'CBTRN01C Z-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS NOT NUMERIC alpha branch'
            MOCK CALL 'CEE3ABD'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            MOVE '0A' TO IO-STATUS
            PERFORM Z-DISPLAY-IO-STATUS
            EXPECT IO-STATUS-04(1:1) TO BE '0'
            VERIFY CALL 'CEE3ABD' NEVER HAPPENED

